        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/president-macron-attends-orion-26-excerices",
        "orario": "15:02",
        "timestamp": 1777640562,
        "contenuto_esteso": "In France, President Emmanuel Macron attended the final phase of the “Orion 26” military exercises on Thursday, a large-scale combat simulation involving thousands of troops from France and several European nations. The drills, which began in February, highlight a growing focus on military readiness across Europe amid Russia’s ongoing invasion of Ukraine, as Monte Francis reports."
